{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Spatial Knowledge.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Spatial Knowledge.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"spatial knowledge spatial knowledge","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Spatial Knowledge.md","fileName":"Spatial Knowledge.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Spatial Knowledge","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-05 13:11\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Spatial Perception and Navigation]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Spatial Perception and Navigation","Cognitive Map","Wayfinding","Reference Frame","3duserinterfaces2ande.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Spatial Knowledge.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Spatial Knowledge.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"spatial knowledge spatial knowledge","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Spatial Knowledge.md","fileName":"Spatial Knowledge.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Spatial Knowledge","heading":"Spatial Knowledge","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"Spatial knowledge is remembered information about an environment and its arrangement. It forms a [[Cognitive Map]] and supports [[Wayfinding]].\n\nThree important forms are:\n\n- Landmark knowledge: visual characteristics and distinctive objects.\n- Route knowledge: sequences of actions needed to follow paths between places.\n- Survey knowledge: map-like knowledge of locations, distances, orientations, and topology.\n\nPeople often begin with landmark information, learn routes between landmarks, and gradually develop survey knowledge. Travel methods, viewpoints, maps, and [[Reference Frame]]s can change which forms are acquired and how easily they are used.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Spatial Perception and Navigation","Cognitive Map","Wayfinding","Reference Frame","3duserinterfaces2ande.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Spatial Knowledge.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Spatial Knowledge.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"spatial knowledge spatial knowledge","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Spatial Knowledge.md","fileName":"Spatial Knowledge.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Spatial Knowledge","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[3duserinterfaces2ande.pdf]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Spatial Perception and Navigation","Cognitive Map","Wayfinding","Reference Frame","3duserinterfaces2ande.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}